keywords:
  - financial documents
  - evidence sufficiency
  - provenance
  - abstention
  - deterministic reconciliation
  - retrieval-augmented generation
abstract: >-
  An experimental research prototype exploring financial-document consistency
  and explicit reference-evidence sufficiency checks. Archived studies include
  synthetic comparisons and financial-report question answering. The project
  does not establish real-bank-fraud adjudication or superior classification
  accuracy over equally informed deterministic checking.
